{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_19f537cf", "timestamp": "2026-06-29T07:34:00", "text": "Hi team, let's review the Technical Specifications Document and update it based on the latest issues reported. We need to address the performance, documentation, integration, reliability, and user interface concerns. Let's dive in! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260629-0-4b661"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260629-0-4b661"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8c71a7a9", "timestamp": "2026-06-29T07:38:00", "text": "@eid_19f537cf, for the auto-tuning process being resource-intensive, I suggest we add a section on optimizing the algorithms for low-power systems. We should also specify minimum system requirements more clearly.", "utterranceID": "20260629-1-57290"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260629-1-57290"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6f719d21", "timestamp": "2026-06-29T07:40:00", "text": "Agreed, Hannah. We could also explore simplifying the algorithms or offering a 'light' mode for less powerful systems. This might help with performance issues.", "utterranceID": "20260629-2-b3b90"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260629-2-b3b90"}
