{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-fbc815"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e5e36dc1", "timestamp": "2026-09-25T00:25:00", "text": "Hi team, I've found some interesting open-source bugs that might help us with our current Salesforce issues. Let's take a look at them! 😊", "utterranceID": "20260924-0-cd21e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260924-0-cd21e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-fbc815"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e5e36dc1", "timestamp": "2026-09-25T00:30:00", "text": "First up, we have a bug in Kubernetes titled 'Incorrect Pod Scheduling Recommendations'. The scheduler is suggesting unnecessary node changes for pods that are already optimally placed, which affects cluster efficiency. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/pull/1517. @eid_9a7b2132, this seems similar to our load balancing issue. What do you think?", "utterranceID": "20260924-1-a101e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260924-1-a101e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-fbc815"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9a7b2132", "timestamp": "2026-09-25T00:35:00", "text": "Thanks, Alice! This is definitely relevant. I'll review the PR to see how they addressed the scheduling logic and apply any useful insights to our AI Model & Analysis Engine. 👍", "utterranceID": "20260924-2-9d8f0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260924-2-9d8f0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-fbc815"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e5e36dc1", "timestamp": "2026-09-25T00:39:00", "text": "Great, Ian! Next, there's a PostgreSQL bug titled 'Inconsistent Timestamp Storage'. Timestamps for transaction logs are recorded inconsistently, which could lead to data integrity issues. Check out the PR here: https://github.com/postgres/postgres/pull/1518. Fiona, this sounds a lot like our timestamp handling problem. Thoughts?", "utterranceID": "20260924-3-091e2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260924-3-091e2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-fbc815"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_399e4119", "timestamp": "2026-09-25T00:40:00", "text": "Absolutely, Alice! I'll dive into the PR and see how they tackled the timestamp inconsistencies. It might give us some ideas for fixing our synchronization logic. 🕒", "utterranceID": "20260924-4-3cae5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260924-4-3cae5"}

