{"Channel": {"name": "planning-castAIX", "channelID": "ch-staix-62a6a5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3b36c220", "timestamp": "2026-04-10T07:38:00", "text": "Yes, @eid_bd791efc, that sounds like a solid plan. Let's add a 'Performance Optimization' subsection under 'System Architecture' to tackle these issues. 🏗️", "utterranceID": "20260410-5-75809"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260410-5-75809"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-castAIX", "channelID": "ch-staix-62a6a5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7871ba4e", "timestamp": "2026-04-10T07:43:00", "text": "For integration, we need to expand on the 'Integration Capabilities' section. Adding more API support and flexibility in architecture could help. Maybe we can also mention potential partnerships with third-party data providers? 🤝", "utterranceID": "20260410-6-42746"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260410-6-42746"}
