{"Channel": {"name": "planning-castAIX", "channelID": "ch-staix-62a6a5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3b36c220", "timestamp": "2026-04-10T07:57:00", "text": "Thanks for the great input, everyone! I'll summarize the key changes: 1) Simplify UI and add onboarding resources, 2) Optimize performance for large datasets, 3) Enhance integration capabilities, 4) Improve prediction accuracy, and 5) Add customization options. Next steps: I'll draft these updates and share them for final review. Let's aim to finalize by end of the week. 🙌", "utterranceID": "20260410-12-cdc1e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260410-12-cdc1e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-castAIX", "channelID": "ch-staix-62a6a5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3b36c220", "timestamp": "2026-04-12T12:04:00", "text": "Here is the updated <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/new_castaix_product_requirements_document|Product Requirements Document>, thank you everyone!", "utterranceID": "20260412-0-de122"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260412-0-de122"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-castAIX", "channelID": "ch-staix-62a6a5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f9e25d18", "timestamp": "2026-04-14T21:02:00", "text": "Hi team, let's review the Technical Specifications Document and update it based on the latest issues reported. We need to address the user interface complexity, performance with large datasets, integration limitations, prediction inaccuracies, and lack of customization options. Let's dive in! 😊", "utterranceID": "20260413-0-33cb9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260413-0-33cb9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-castAIX", "channelID": "ch-staix-62a6a5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86044ae5", "timestamp": "2026-04-14T21:04:00", "text": "@eid_f9e25d18 Bob, for the user interface, I suggest we add a section on simplifying the layout. We could introduce a phased feature rollout for new users to prevent overwhelming them. Thoughts?", "utterranceID": "20260413-1-02bc6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260413-1-02bc6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-castAIX", "channelID": "ch-staix-62a6a5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7871ba4e", "timestamp": "2026-04-14T21:08:00", "text": "I agree with @eid_86044ae5. Also, we should include more intuitive navigation guides and tooltips in the UI section. This could help new users get up to speed faster. 🧭", "utterranceID": "20260413-2-b2ee1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260413-2-b2ee1"}
