{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_990f697c", "timestamp": "2027-02-14T16:12:00", "text": "Appreciate the resources, Julia! I'll keep you posted on any progress. 👍", "utterranceID": "20270214-9-d01d9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270214-9-d01d9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7db4431d", "timestamp": "2027-02-15T09:39:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect UI rendering on mobile devices has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/SearchForce/pull/29.", "utterranceID": "20270214-0-79e34"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270214-0-79e34"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7db4431d", "timestamp": "2027-02-15T09:40:00", "text": "The issue was caused by CSS and responsive design inconsistencies that didn't adapt well to different screen sizes and resolutions.", "utterranceID": "20270214-1-051e3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270214-1-051e3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7db4431d", "timestamp": "2027-02-15T09:41:00", "text": "To fix it, I updated the CSS media queries to ensure better compatibility across various devices. I also adjusted some flexbox properties to maintain the layout integrity on smaller screens.", "utterranceID": "20270214-2-19aba"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270214-2-19aba"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_160fca3c", "timestamp": "2027-02-15T09:46:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_7db4431d! Thanks for jumping on this so quickly. I'll test it on a few devices to make sure everything looks good.", "utterranceID": "20270214-3-3eb34"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270214-3-3eb34"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0b6cb92", "timestamp": "2027-02-15T09:48:00", "text": "Thanks, David Jones! This should really improve the user experience on mobile. Let me know if you need any help with further testing.", "utterranceID": "20270214-4-79a31"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270214-4-79a31"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7db4431d", "timestamp": "2027-02-15T09:50:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_160fca3c and Julia. Let me know if you find any other issues during testing. I'll be around to help.", "utterranceID": "20270214-5-340e7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270214-5-340e7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7db4431d", "timestamp": "2027-02-15T15:10:00", "text": "Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about the 'Delayed Database Replication' that was causing inconsistent search results in SearchForce.", "utterranceID": "20270215-0-b87cd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270215-0-b87cd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7db4431d", "timestamp": "2027-02-15T15:14:00", "text": "After reviewing the situation, I've determined that this is not a bug that requires fixing.", "utterranceID": "20270215-1-3505d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270215-1-3505d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_160fca3c", "timestamp": "2027-02-15T15:19:00", "text": "Hey David Jones, could you elaborate on why it's not a bug?", "utterranceID": "20270215-2-2f407"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270215-2-2f407"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7db4431d", "timestamp": "2027-02-15T15:20:00", "text": "Sure, @eid_160fca3c. The delays in database replication are due to network latency and configuration issues. These are expected behaviors given our current infrastructure setup.", "utterranceID": "20270215-3-24567"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270215-3-24567"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7db4431d", "timestamp": "2027-02-15T15:21:00", "text": "The system is designed to eventually sync all nodes, but some latency is unavoidable due to the distributed nature of our database.", "utterranceID": "20270215-4-e98b2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270215-4-e98b2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0b6cb92", "timestamp": "2027-02-15T15:25:00", "text": "So, are there any steps we need to take to address the network latency?", "utterranceID": "20270215-5-961e3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270215-5-961e3"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13786f09", "timestamp": "2027-04-01T15:10:00", "text": "The root cause was that the query optimizer wasn't effectively rewriting queries to minimize execution time. This resulted in complex query plans that consumed more resources and time.", "utterranceID": "20270401-2-a412e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270401-2-a412e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13786f09", "timestamp": "2027-04-01T15:11:00", "text": "To fix this, I implemented a new heuristic in the query optimizer that prioritizes simpler query plans and reduces the number of nested loops. This change significantly improves the execution time of queries.", "utterranceID": "20270401-3-26de1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270401-3-26de1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13786f09", "timestamp": "2027-04-01T15:14:00", "text": "You can check out the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/SearchForce/pull/36", "utterranceID": "20270401-4-1a9fa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270401-4-1a9fa"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_990f697c", "timestamp": "2027-04-01T15:17:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_13786f09! This should really help with the performance issues we've been seeing.", "utterranceID": "20270401-5-66a37"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270401-5-66a37"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_160fca3c", "timestamp": "2027-04-01T15:18:00", "text": "Thanks, Alice! This was a critical fix. I'll keep an eye on the performance metrics to see how much improvement we get.", "utterranceID": "20270401-6-2e6b0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270401-6-2e6b0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0b6cb92", "timestamp": "2027-04-01T15:19:00", "text": "Awesome job, Alice! Let me know if there's anything else you need from the QA side to verify the fix.", "utterranceID": "20270401-7-b8061"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270401-7-b8061"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13786f09", "timestamp": "2027-04-01T15:22:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! @George Davis, @David Garcia, and Julia, your support was crucial. Let's monitor the system and ensure everything runs smoothly.", "utterranceID": "20270401-8-5c026"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270401-8-5c026"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_160fca3c", "timestamp": "2027-04-02T04:10:00", "text": "Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about the 'Flawed Contextual Query Parsing' in SearchForce.", "utterranceID": "20270401-0-f9cb1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270401-0-f9cb1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_160fca3c", "timestamp": "2027-04-02T04:13:00", "text": "The concern was that the AI-powered contextual parsing mechanism misinterprets certain query structures, leading to unintended database operations.", "utterranceID": "20270401-1-812fa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270401-1-812fa"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_160fca3c", "timestamp": "2027-04-02T04:16:00", "text": "After a thorough review, I've concluded that this does not require a fix.", "utterranceID": "20270401-2-a5156"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270401-2-a5156"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13786f09", "timestamp": "2027-04-02T04:21:00", "text": "Hey David, could you elaborate on why it's not a bug?", "utterranceID": "20270401-3-6f74a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270401-3-6f74a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_160fca3c", "timestamp": "2027-04-02T04:26:00", "text": "Sure, Alice. The behavior observed is actually expected given the current configuration of the NLP model.", "utterranceID": "20270401-4-77031"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270401-4-77031"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_160fca3c", "timestamp": "2027-04-02T04:31:00", "text": "The model is designed to handle a wide range of query structures, but it requires precise input to function optimally.", "utterranceID": "20270401-5-27746"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270401-5-27746"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_160fca3c", "timestamp": "2027-04-02T04:32:00", "text": "In this case, the misinterpretation arises from ambiguous query phrasing, which is more of a user misunderstanding rather than a flaw in the system.", "utterranceID": "20270401-6-af15e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270401-6-af15e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_990f697c", "timestamp": "2027-04-02T04:34:00", "text": "Thanks for clarifying, David. Did you take any specific actions to verify this?", "utterranceID": "20270401-7-c4212"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270401-7-c4212"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_160fca3c", "timestamp": "2027-04-02T04:35:00", "text": "Yes, George. I ran several tests with different query structures to see how the model responds.", "utterranceID": "20270401-8-4be77"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270401-8-4be77"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_160fca3c", "timestamp": "2027-04-02T04:38:00", "text": "The results were consistent with the expected behavior outlined in our documentation.", "utterranceID": "20270401-9-935d4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270401-9-935d4"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_160fca3c", "timestamp": "2027-02-10T17:46:00", "text": "The algorithm is designed to cast a wide net to ensure comprehensive search results, which can sometimes include broader synonym sets.", "utterranceID": "20270210-3-1eea0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270210-3-1eea0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_160fca3c", "timestamp": "2027-02-10T17:49:00", "text": "This approach helps in scenarios where users might use less common synonyms, ensuring they still get relevant results.", "utterranceID": "20270210-4-44853"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270210-4-44853"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7db4431d", "timestamp": "2027-02-10T17:52:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, David. So, no changes needed on our end?", "utterranceID": "20270210-5-8dc8a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270210-5-8dc8a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_160fca3c", "timestamp": "2027-02-10T17:56:00", "text": "Correct, @eid_7db4431d. No changes are necessary. I did a thorough check to confirm that the algorithm is functioning as intended.", "utterranceID": "20270210-6-991ad"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270210-6-991ad"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0b6cb92", "timestamp": "2027-02-10T18:00:00", "text": "Got it, David Garcia. Should we communicate this to the users to prevent future confusion?", "utterranceID": "20270210-7-493a2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270210-7-493a2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_160fca3c", "timestamp": "2027-02-10T18:04:00", "text": "Yes, @eid_d0b6cb92, that's a good idea. We can update the user documentation to clarify how the synonym expansion works and why it might include broader results.", "utterranceID": "20270210-8-c9a07"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270210-8-c9a07"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7db4431d", "timestamp": "2027-02-10T18:08:00", "text": "I'll draft a note for the documentation team to include this clarification. Thanks for the investigation, David.", "utterranceID": "20270210-9-e8b12"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270210-9-e8b12"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_160fca3c", "timestamp": "2027-02-10T18:09:00", "text": "No problem, David Jones. Let me know if there's anything else you need from me.", "utterranceID": "20270210-10-fdd41"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270210-10-fdd41"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0b6cb92", "timestamp": "2027-02-13T09:59:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with SearchForce that we need to address. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20270212-0-b9fdd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270212-0-b9fdd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0b6cb92", "timestamp": "2027-02-13T10:00:00", "text": "First up, we have an issue titled 'Entity Recognition Failure in Ambiguous Queries'. The NLP Engine is struggling to identify and differentiate entities in ambiguous queries, leading to irrelevant search results. This is impacting customer CUST-0070, and it's crucial we resolve this to prevent user frustration. @eid_160fca3c, this one's for you.", "utterranceID": "20270212-1-d2306"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270212-1-d2306"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_160fca3c", "timestamp": "2027-02-13T10:02:00", "text": "Got it! I'll dive into the NLP Engine and see what's causing the entity recognition failure. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20270212-2-00ae6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270212-2-00ae6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0b6cb92", "timestamp": "2027-02-13T10:06:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have an 'Incorrect Flexbox Implementation' issue. The layout management on the search results page is causing elements to overlap or misalign on mobile devices, affecting customer CUST-0003. This is impacting the User Interface (UI). @eid_160fca3c, you're also on this one.", "utterranceID": "20270212-3-d3be6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270212-3-d3be6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_160fca3c", "timestamp": "2027-02-13T10:10:00", "text": "Understood! I'll check the Flexbox implementation and make sure the UI is responsive on mobile devices. Let's get this sorted for CUST-0003. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270212-4-2919e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270212-4-2919e"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0b6cb92", "timestamp": "2027-03-28T07:35:00", "text": "Hi team, I've found some interesting open-source bugs that are similar to the ones we're tackling in Salesforce. Let's take a look and see if we can learn anything from them! 😊", "utterranceID": "20270328-0-b0cbc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270328-0-b0cbc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0b6cb92", "timestamp": "2027-03-28T07:38:00", "text": "First up, there's an issue in WordPress titled 'Insecure REST API Endpoint Exposure'. This is quite similar to our 'Insecure API Endpoint Exposure' issue. You can check out the PR here: https://github.com/WordPress/WordPress/pull/1750. @eid_e5715d9e, this might be particularly relevant for you!", "utterranceID": "20270328-1-09172"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270328-1-09172"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e5715d9e", "timestamp": "2027-03-28T07:39:00", "text": "Thanks, Julia! I'll review the WordPress PR to see how they addressed the security concerns. It might give us some good insights for securing our endpoint. 🔒", "utterranceID": "20270328-2-43ab6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270328-2-43ab6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0b6cb92", "timestamp": "2027-03-28T07:42:00", "text": "Next, we have a React issue titled 'Image Asset Loading Delays in React Components'. This is similar to our 'Image Asset Loading Delays' problem. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/facebook/react/pull/1751. Alice, this could be useful for your work on the UI issues.", "utterranceID": "20270328-3-d597c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270328-3-d597c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13786f09", "timestamp": "2027-03-28T07:45:00", "text": "Great find, Julia! I'll dive into the React PR and see how they tackled the image loading delays. Hopefully, it will help us improve the mobile user experience. 📱", "utterranceID": "20270328-4-876b7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270328-4-876b7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0b6cb92", "timestamp": "2027-03-28T07:47:00", "text": "Lastly, there's an Elasticsearch issue titled 'Cache Eviction Policy Misconfiguration'. This aligns with our cache issue. Check out the PR here: https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/1752. David, this might be right up your alley!", "utterranceID": "20270328-5-09f37"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270328-5-09f37"}
