{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-ProposalForce", "channelID": "ch-force-33bda1"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ee9ca887", "timestamp": "2027-06-14T21:06:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks! Lastly, we have an 'Insecure Direct Object Reference (IDOR) in Proposal URLs'. The URLs are predictable and lack proper authorization checks, which is a big security risk. This affects the Access Control & Security Module and impacts customer CUST-0034. @eid_0deececb, can you also take this one? 🔐", "utterranceID": "20270614-5-53d61"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270614-5-53d61"}
