{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-1deacc"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8605f7ee", "timestamp": "2026-06-20T23:54:00", "text": "Hi @eid_71071933, I'll take a look as well. The decoupling sounds promising for our scalability goals. 👍", "utterranceID": "20260623-2-703c6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260623-2-703c6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-1deacc"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9a7b2132", "timestamp": "2026-06-20T23:55:00", "text": "Okay, I've gone through the PR. The integration of the event-driven architecture looks solid, and I can see how components are now decoupled and communicating via events. Great work on that front! 🎉", "utterranceID": "20260623-3-ded36"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260623-3-ded36"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-1deacc"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8605f7ee", "timestamp": "2026-06-20T23:56:00", "text": "I agree with Ian, the decoupling is well-executed. However, I noticed that the system tests don't fully confirm that the new architecture maintains or improves current performance metrics. Some tests are showing a slight lag in response times. 🤔", "utterranceID": "20260623-4-2b568"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260623-4-2b568"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-1deacc"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_71071933", "timestamp": "2026-06-21T00:01:00", "text": "Thanks for the feedback, @eid_8605f7ee. I'll dive into the performance tests and see what's causing the lag. Maybe some event handling needs optimization. I'll update the PR once I have a fix. 🔍", "utterranceID": "20260623-5-fcc84"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260623-5-fcc84"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0d918f1", "timestamp": "2026-10-15T09:38:00", "text": "Will do, Alice! I'll update once I have more info on the sync issue. 📊", "utterranceID": "20261015-8-8ec42"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261015-8-8ec42"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d098d618", "timestamp": "2026-10-15T09:39:00", "text": "Same here, I'll keep you posted on the data transformation improvements. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261015-9-74898"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261015-9-74898"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc0f17c3", "timestamp": "2026-10-15T09:40:00", "text": "I'll share updates on the security fix as soon as possible. 🔐", "utterranceID": "20261015-10-b3a4d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261015-10-b3a4d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc0f17c3", "timestamp": "2026-10-18T17:45:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Security Vulnerability in API Flow Authentication' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/FlowForce/pull/41.", "utterranceID": "20261018-0-b4f1e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261018-0-b4f1e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc0f17c3", "timestamp": "2026-10-18T17:48:00", "text": "The root cause was improper validation of authentication tokens in the API flow management module, which allowed unauthorized access to API flows.", "utterranceID": "20261018-1-14f08"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261018-1-14f08"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc0f17c3", "timestamp": "2026-10-18T17:52:00", "text": "To fix this, I implemented a stricter validation process for authentication tokens, ensuring they are verified against a secure token registry before granting access to any API flows.", "utterranceID": "20261018-2-c240c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261018-2-c240c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0d918f1", "timestamp": "2026-10-18T17:57:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_fc0f17c3! This was a critical issue, and I'm glad it's resolved. Thanks for the quick turnaround.", "utterranceID": "20261018-3-921aa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261018-3-921aa"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-10-18T18:02:00", "text": "Thanks, Fiona! This fix will definitely enhance our security posture. I'll update the documentation to reflect these changes.", "utterranceID": "20261018-4-2e3b8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261018-4-2e3b8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d098d618", "timestamp": "2026-10-18T18:05:00", "text": "Nice job, Fiona. Do we need to run any additional tests to ensure everything is working as expected?", "utterranceID": "20261018-5-9d1bb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261018-5-9d1bb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc0f17c3", "timestamp": "2026-10-18T18:10:00", "text": "@eid_d098d618, yes, I've already run the initial tests, but it would be great if the QA team could perform a thorough regression test to confirm everything is stable.", "utterranceID": "20261018-6-5c773"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261018-6-5c773"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d098d618", "timestamp": "2026-10-18T18:14:00", "text": "Got it, I'll coordinate with QA to get that scheduled. Thanks again, Fiona!", "utterranceID": "20261018-7-8e9bb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261018-7-8e9bb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T22:50:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with the FlowForce feature. Let's go through them and assign accordingly. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261021-0-ab73f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261021-0-ab73f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T22:51:00", "text": "First up, we have an issue titled 'API Flow Analysis Incorrectly Identifies Bottlenecks'. The AI Model & Analysis Engine is inaccurately flagging certain API endpoints as bottlenecks, which could lead to unnecessary optimizations. This is impacting customer CUST-0029. @eid_d0d918f1, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20261021-1-8214d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261021-1-8214d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0d918f1", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T22:55:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll dive into the AI Model & Analysis Engine and see what's causing the false positives. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20261021-2-559c3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261021-2-559c3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T22:59:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have a 'Suboptimal Load Balancing Algorithm' issue. The load balancing isn't distributing API requests evenly, causing some servers to overload. This is affecting customer CUST-0038. @eid_d098d618, can you handle this?", "utterranceID": "20261021-3-c7106"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261021-3-c7106"}

