{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86044ae5", "timestamp": "2026-10-07T09:03:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks everyone for jumping on these so quickly! Let me know if you need any more details or support. Let's get these resolved for our customers! 💪", "utterranceID": "20261007-7-cabd4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261007-7-cabd4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2604c806", "timestamp": "2026-10-07T09:08:00", "text": "Will do! I'll keep you posted on the progress. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261007-8-01747"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261007-8-01747"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1bf91687", "timestamp": "2026-10-07T09:13:00", "text": "Same here, I'll update once I have a fix ready. 🛠️", "utterranceID": "20261007-9-d7393"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261007-9-d7393"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_dbc6178f", "timestamp": "2026-10-07T09:14:00", "text": "I'll share updates as I work through the API issue. Thanks again! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20261007-10-fe3f8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261007-10-fe3f8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86044ae5", "timestamp": "2026-10-09T12:41:00", "text": "Hi team, I've found some interesting open-source bugs that might help us with our current issues. Let's take a look at them together! 😊", "utterranceID": "20261009-0-710bf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261009-0-710bf"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86044ae5", "timestamp": "2026-10-09T12:45:00", "text": "First up, we have a bug in TensorFlow titled 'Inefficient GPU Utilization in Model Training'. It seems that training large models on GPUs is not as efficient as it could be due to poor resource allocation, which slows down the training process. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/tensorflow/tensorflow/pull/1288. @eid_2604c806, this sounds similar to the GPU utilization issue you're working on. Thoughts?", "utterranceID": "20261009-1-5e0c4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261009-1-5e0c4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2604c806", "timestamp": "2026-10-09T12:50:00", "text": "Thanks, George! This is definitely relevant. It looks like they tackled the problem by optimizing resource allocation. I'll review their approach and see if we can apply similar strategies to our visualization engine. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261009-2-20e3d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261009-2-20e3d"}

