{"Channel": {"name": "develop-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-a-aix-2eecee"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_88e74382", "timestamp": "2026-06-18T07:53:00", "text": "Hi team, I noticed that PR# 12 was approved and merged, but I've heard that the product direction has changed. Should we consider reverting it?", "utterranceID": "20260618-0-350a6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260618-0-350a6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-a-aix-2eecee"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_55f01e31", "timestamp": "2026-06-18T07:54:00", "text": "Hey, can someone clarify what the new product direction is? I want to understand why the automated retraining pipeline might be unnecessary now.", "utterranceID": "20260618-1-3062b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260618-1-3062b"}
